--- !u!114 &5423412412138818893
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4201027789461109171}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d9003cfd3a5f54cfdac11731a4de5513, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  images:
  - {fileID: 7263439901110554805, guid: f1f6e5b82f4474d9d8d6996b8c6776cb, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 160958108840807288, guid: a49f92e0198754f468c5807bcc72cde2, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 3968054853073981154, guid: 0b47e8ee048e7462a936d59657913a22, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8856119835841316573, guid: 814a9f99ab1044329b751a3a4e1b0f59, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 6332154810236034872, guid: 73d6f1c7bd9c144289d434e7da4637cc, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8463857592527208847, guid: 65efc43ddc2ee48919d9e110c9e6d1e6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1257930520043580265, guid: b481c96e604da40e4bf68057e518c747, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 7465710475939400493, guid: 2eed8ef5d5eaa4ef0b07b1ae8bfdb020, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 2322904428978907690, guid: 6a788f25e19104b7eb0e679252051d3e, type: 3}
  text:
  - First time having a friend over! I think she likes my music box! She also likes
    the stars!
  - First day of summer! We went to the treehouse again. It was really fun - I won
    all our races :D
  - Last day together. I miss them already. 12 years gone so fast, I wish we had
    more time.
  - "I guess it\u2019s time to let go of my childish dreams. I need to be realistic
    about the future."
  - "I hope I\u2019m making the right choice. Well, I suppose I won\u2019t hate this
    decision. I must be reasonable."
  - The Academy is harder than I thought. Everyone is so passionate here, I feel
    strange. Am I the only one who struggles?
  - "I feel like I\u2019m drowning in work. I wish I had the time to see the stars
    again. I miss my friends, are they still looking at the same sky? I can\u2019t
    do this anymore. Tomorrow I\u2019ll look into that offer. I can\u2019t live like
    this."
  - "Ah. They were right. I don\u2019t like this either, it\u2019s nothing like I
    thought it would be. I wonder if there's something wrong with me; why am I not
    happy? I finally achieved our dreams\u2026but there's no one to cheer me on."
  - "I\u2019m so tired everyday. I wonder what my friends would think; It\u2019s
    been so long since I\u2019ve seen them, do they even remember me?...I bet they
    would be disappointed in who I\u2019ve become. Honestly,  I\u2019m disappointed
    too."
